  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## target vs currentTarget\n\nThe event starts at the clicked node (`target`) and bubbles up. `currentTarget` is the node whose listener is running.\n\nListen on `#outer`. When `#inner` is clicked, set `#out` to `inner>outer` using target id then currentTarget id."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "target",
      "promptMd": "You click the inner button. `event.target` is…",
      "kind": "mcq",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outer",
          "md": "The parent with the listener"
        },
        {
          "id": "inner",
          "md": "The inner button"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "inner"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "bubble-ids",
      "engine": "javascript",
      "entry": "main.js",
      "promptMd": "> On click of `#outer`, write `targetId>currentId` into `#out`. Hidden test clicks `#inner`.",
      "preview": {
        "kind": "iframe"
      },
      "files": [
